title: "APGI: Allostatic Precision-Gated Ignition — reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Allostatic Precision-Gated Ignition (APGI)
  framework: a computational model of conscious access as a discrete,
  precision-weighted, metabolically constrained ignition event crossing an
  allostatically regulated threshold. Implements the full 18-step execution
  pipeline of the APGI Mathematical Specification, including hierarchical
  multi-timescale dynamics, Kuramoto phase coupling, a liquid-state-machine
  reservoir substrate, and Landauer-grounded thermodynamic constraints.
